{"parse": {"title": "DAU-04", "pageid": 40843, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/DAU-03\" title=\"DAU-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">DAU-04</span><a href=\"/wiki/DAU-05\" title=\"DAU-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">DAU</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">04</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.B2.A1.E6.9C.89.E5.AF.84.E5.87.BA.E7.9A.84.E4.BF.A1\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"没有寄出的信\">没有寄出的信</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 没有寄出的信</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Letters Unsent</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 1860104</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuizoulang2\"><img alt=\"jijinhuizoulang2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623711.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-623711.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623711.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623711.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-623711.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623711.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-623711.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623711.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>维拉不太理解命名日突然的沉默。自己提出的问题应该不至于这样使人为难，甚至令一个热情开朗的年轻人都失去语言的能力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>于是她歪了歪头，试图以扩大躯体动作的幅度来唤起眼前人的注意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>命名日先生？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>啊，抱歉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>我只是在想，要怎样说出结果才不至于使您太过失望。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>哎。我已经说过，你不必太纠结于措辞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>谨慎当然是好的，但在我已经明确表达了信任和需要的时候，你固执的局促比起使我失望，不如说更让我伤心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>天哪，女士，我绝对不是故意——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>那就请直接告诉我吧，命名日先生。我真的很需要知道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>维拉望着眼前的年轻人。由于身量的差距，她需要微微抬起下巴，才能更好地传达那种坚决。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在这种眼神的注视之下，命名日退缩了。他既应付不来小孩，也应付不来太过正直的人们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>好吧，好吧……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>既然您已经注意到了人员流动相当频繁这件事，那应该也能理解为什么我们暂时没有多余的人力，能护送你们回到来亚什基。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>实际上，如果不是这群孩子都还在分部，而我是早早被指派了对接的那个人，我现在可能也已经被调拨去外勤了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>……人员这样缺乏吗？是不是发生了什么事？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>不是客人需要担心的事情。既然您已经问起来了，那我也会帮你们多留意最近有没有目的地为北边的外勤任务。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>要是运气够好，也许我的同事们可以捎上一程呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>如果有就再好不过了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>那么，来亚什基现在的情况又怎么样呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>实际上，我也没有太多的了解……不过听收音机上说，来亚什基的旅游业似乎发展得如火如荼，而且，我们的行政部门在考虑将其列入年度疗养地名录。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>至少听上去都挺不错的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>其他方面呢，矿场如何？码头还在继续修缮吗？芝诺的军队完全撤离了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>唉，这些更具体的东西，我就一个也不清楚了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>思索的光芒在维拉蓝色的瞳孔里闪烁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>如果暂时没法回去，那么，或许我可以写信给他们。<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>对！怎么之前我没有想到呢。基金会与来亚什基要达成合作的话，也得问问更多人的意见……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>我得赶紧——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>果决和雷厉风行向来是描述维拉最好的词语。此刻当然也不例外。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>女士……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>先不说能替您送信的人有没有，要是您这会儿走了，阿夫西维他们怎么办？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>当然，我不是在指责您！但刚才您也瞧见了，我一个人真的搞不定这些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>噢，天哪。是的，我总是忘记你们现在人员缺乏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>可就真的一点人也没有了吗？只是送信也没办法，这多少有些不合常理了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>送信的人当然有。我只是想说，等您写完随时可以转交，不用这么着急。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>所以现在，让我们还是在这儿晒晒太阳吧……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>……好吧，我想你说得对。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>现在还有时间。我可以先想想，都要向大伙儿了解些什么。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuikefang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuikefang\"><img alt=\"jijinhuikefang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-jijinhuikefang.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuikefang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-jijinhuikefang.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuikefang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-jijinhuikefang.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuikefang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>将孩子们都安全送回各自的临时宿舍，且与命名日告别之后，维拉带着更多空白纸张回到客房。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她把这些纸在桌面上逐张摊开，整个下午都充斥脑海的问题都在此刻毫无遗漏地再次浮现了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——由思念构成的关怀落在笔尖，每一个句子都自发地以温暖充斥胸腔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>“致克·亚·拉扎列夫。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“亲爱的同志们……”</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuizoulang2\"><img alt=\"jijinhuizoulang2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“……无论打开这封信的是谁，都请找把舒适的椅子，好好地坐下来读一读，而不是站在炉子面前随意地翻阅。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“因为我接下来要讲的，每一件都是对咱们来说顶重要的事……”</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuizoulang\"><img alt=\"jijinhuizoulang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>命名日先生，这些信要麻烦你转交——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“在正式开始之前，我理应为这段时间的失联而道歉。真希望当你们收到这封信的时候，孩子们与我也已经坐在了回程的列车上……”</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuidatang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuidatang\"><img alt=\"jijinhuidatang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/Cg-jijinhuidatang.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuidatang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/Cg-jijinhuidatang.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuidatang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/Cg-jijinhuidatang.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuidatang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>这些是今天的信，麻烦你一定送到……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“……问题太多，我总是难以取舍先后，只好想到哪里就写到哪里了……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“……与基金会的合作沟通，由于一些未知的不可抗力，暂时进入了停滞状态。但这封信仍需向各位一线工作者确认更多细节，以便接下来随时可能恢复的交涉……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“请原谅这些繁琐问题，它们涉及各个方面。其中很多都是我应该更早更积极地关切的……”</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuiyishiting.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuiyishiting\"><img alt=\"jijinhuiyishiting\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-jijinhuiyishiting.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuiyishiting.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-jijinhuiyishiting.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuiyishiting.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-jijinhuiyishiting.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuiyishiting.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-308710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-308710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-308710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>你在这里！这是新的信件，辛苦了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“……码头的修缮工作如何了？与周边城市的交往增进也应该已经提上日程。在这些之外，房屋的重建与维护是不是早就结束了？”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“……请留意：新建屋顶的防水板也该备足，不多时就要入秋，供暖也应该早做准备。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“不过，我们现在有了煤矿，这些都应当不成问题……”</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuikefang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuikefang\"><img alt=\"jijinhuikefang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-jijinhuikefang.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuikefang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-jijinhuikefang.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuikefang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-jijinhuikefang.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuikefang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“…………”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“……祝好，仍然盼复。你们最忠诚的朋友维拉。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>呼，好了。命名日先生，今天还是要麻烦你了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>维拉把信纸叠好，放进信封中。做完这一切，她才注意到原本以为足够用到返程的信纸已经所剩无几。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这超出了她的预计，所以小小的惊讶不期然出现在脸上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>信纸居然用得这么快……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>是啊。恐怕您再这样写下去，我就只能去花园里砍了那棵松树给您做纸了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>旁边给北方哨歌女士的信呢？我看您也落了款，应该是写完了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>实话实说吧，还没有。我不知道她那边的情况，也不清楚她还愿不愿意回到小镇去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>直接提问或许有些冒犯，我正在思考应该怎样修改措辞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>她是做“理线学”研究的那个人，对吗？我听说前些日子她在总部的演讲很成功。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>如果是这样，那么您至少可以恭喜她，然后告知一下近况……之类的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>也许是见维拉许久没有回应，命名日说话的声音也逐渐减小下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>抱歉，我没怎么写过信，所以这也只是胡乱建议。就跟站在岸边往冰面丢石头块一样，指望有一块地方是脆弱的，好打出个洞来钓鱼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>……总之，您听听就得了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>不，你说的很有道理。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>我知道该怎么写了。感谢你，命名日先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>请再等一下。我马上写完它，你就可以一起带走了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623711.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-623711.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623711.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623711.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-623711.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623711.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-623711.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623711.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>好的，不用急。我就坐在这儿，玩玩小刀，雕点东西，消磨一下时间……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>消磨时间……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>唉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>真不明白这样下去有什么意义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在命名日面前，由信封和信纸堆成的小山已经来到他小腿的一半高度。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>算了，好歹也不是每一封都寄不出去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>哈哈……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但眼前的确几乎全是寄出去也不会有任何回音的东西，它们就像这里其他的垃圾一样沉默着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在这些信件面前，世界是一个克莱因瓶，任何流淌进去的东西都抵达不了终点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>面对此种场景，年轻人只感到一阵辛辣攥住了他的喉咙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>最终没有任何叹息以外的声音再从那里出现，他拿起信件小山上头的一封走了出去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>信封上，收件人的位置是一个被斟酌后谨慎写就的名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>收件人：北方哨歌。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "DAU-04"}}